"""
Activity 1: 2D Animation Principles & Kinematics Engine
Implements: Tweening (LERP + Ease), Polygon Morphing, Bouncing Ball Dynamics
Controls: 1=Tweening, 2=Morphing, 3=Dynamics, ESC=Quit
